<p class="wp-block-paragraph">-Continental Classic Tournament Blue League Match: Hangman Adam Page vs. Bandido</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">-Continental Classic Tournament Gold League Match: Jon Moxley vs. Orange Cassidy</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">-Continental Classic Tournament Gold League Match: ‘Speedball’ Mike Bailey vs. Nick Wayne</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">-Mercedes Mone&#8217; championship celebration</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">-Jack Perry vs. Samoa Joe</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">-MJF to speak</p>



<ul class="wp-block-list"></ul>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">*Live coverage of tonight&#8217;s AEW Dynamite will begin at 8:00 pm ET*</p>
